        <!-- 互動小遊戲 B：美味大挑戰（習作猜謎詩） -->
        <div class="bg-[#FFD6E0]/45 border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-black mb-1.5">🕵️ 互動小遊戲 B【美味大挑戰（習作猜謎詩）】</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#7a5f4b] mb-3">讀讀看這兩首描寫食物的詩，根據線索猜出謎底吧！</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <!-- 謎題一：番茄 -->
            <div class="bg-white border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-4">
              <div class="text-xs font-black text-[#E76F51] mb-1">謎題 1｜林玉山 作品（提示：是水果也是蔬菜）</div>
              <div class="bg-[#FFFDF6] border-2 border-dashed border-[#DFD1BE] rounded-xl p-3 text-sm sm:text-base font-bold leading-relaxed mb-3">
