        </div>

        <!-- 寫作加油站：臺灣好滋味童詩變身 -->
        <div class="bg-[#D8F3DC]/50 border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5">
          <h4 class="text-lg font-black mb-1.5">✍️ 寫作加油站【臺灣好滋味童詩變身】</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#7a5f4b] mb-3">三步驟變身童詩：<strong>① 展開聯想 ➡ ② 句子變身（加入生動形容與想像） ➡ ③ 適時分行</strong>！</p>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-sm">
            <div class="bg-white border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2">
              <div class="font-black text-base">🧋 範例 1：珍珠奶茶</div>
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7a5f4b] bg-[#FFFDF6] p-2 rounded-lg border border-[#DFD1BE]">
                <strong>① 展開聯想：</strong>粉圓 ➡ 黑珍珠／冰塊 ➡ 冰山／奶茶 ➡ 褐色大海
              </div>
              <div class="text-[#7a5f4b] bg-[#F8F9FA] p-2.5 rounded-xl">
                <strong>原本句子：</strong>奶茶裡，加入Q彈的粉圓和晶瑩的冰塊，攪拌成甜蜜的飲料。
              </div>
              <div class="bg-[#FFF3B0]/70 border-2 border-[#4a3525] p-3 rounded-xl font-black leading-relaxed">
                ✨ <strong>②③ 變身與分行：</strong><br/>
                一顆一顆<br/>
                黑珍珠撞擊冰山<br/>
                翻滾出褐色大海裡誘人的香甜
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="bg-white border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-4 space-y-2">
              <div class="font-black text-base">🍵 範例 2：臺灣泡茶</div>
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7a5f4b] bg-[#FFFDF6] p-2 rounded-lg border border-[#DFD1BE]">
                <strong>① 展開聯想：</strong>熱水 ➡ 溫泉／舒展 ➡ 迴旋舞動／黃澄澄 ➡ 琥珀色
              </div>
              <div class="text-[#7a5f4b] bg-[#F8F9FA] p-2.5 rounded-xl">
                <strong>原本句子：</strong>茶葉在熱水中漸漸舒展，白開水變得黃澄澄的，散發茶香。
              </div>
              <div class="bg-[#D8F3DC]/70 border-2 border-[#4a3525] p-3 rounded-xl font-black leading-relaxed">
                ✨ <strong>②③ 變身與分行：</strong><br/>
                一片一片<br/>
                茶葉在溫泉中迴旋<br/>
                舞動出琥珀色的芬芳
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ==================== 分頁 4：📝 線上自我測驗（25題完整版） ==================== -->
    <section id="section-quiz" class="hidden fade-in">

      <!-- 階段一：測驗準備畫面 -->
      <div id="quiz-stage-setup" class="sketch-card bg-white p-5 sm:p-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="washi-tape washi-mint"></div>
        <div class="text-center mb-6">
          <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#D8F3DC] border-2 border-[#4a3525] text-xs font-black">Google Classroom 作業專用</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black mt-2">📝 線上自我測驗（25題完整版）</h2>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#7a5f4b] mt-1">先填寫你的班級、座號、姓名，考完即可「一鍵複製成績單文字」貼上 Google Classroom 繳交！</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Google Classroom 學生資料填寫區 -->
        <div id="setupStudentBox" class="bg-[#FFF3B0]/65 border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-4 sm:p-5 mb-6">
          <div class="font-black text-base sm:text-lg mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>📋</span> Google Classroom 學生資料填寫區
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5">
            <div>
              <label for="setupClass" class="block text-sm font-black mb-1">班級 <span class="text-[#E63946]">*</span></label>
              <input id="setupClass" type="text" placeholder="例如：五年一班" class="sketch-input w-full text-base" oninput="saveStudentInfoFromSetup()" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="setupSeat" class="block text-sm font-black mb-1">座號 <span class="text-[#E63946]">*</span></label>
              <input id="setupSeat" type="text" placeholder="例如：05" class="sketch-input w-full text-base" oninput="saveStudentInfoFromSetup()" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="setupName" class="block text-sm font-black mb-1">姓名 <span class="text-[#E63946]">*</span></label>
              <input id="setupName" type="text" placeholder="例如：王小明" class="sketch-input w-full text-base" oninput="saveStudentInfoFromSetup()" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="text-xs text-[#7a5f4b] font-bold mt-2.5">💾 資料會自動記憶於瀏覽器，交卷結算畫面也可以隨時修改喔！</p>
        </div>

        <!-- 測驗模式選擇 -->
        <div class="mb-7">
          <div class="font-black text-base sm:text-lg mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>🎯</span> 選擇測驗模式
          </div>
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
            <button onclick="selectQuizScope('all')" id="scope-all" class="sketch-btn bg-[#FFD6E0] p-4 text-left">
              <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black">🌟 綜合總測驗</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-[#4a3525] mt-1 font-bold">完整 25 題・每題 4 分（滿分 100）</div>
            </button>
            <button onclick="selectQuizScope('l7')" id="scope-l7" class="sketch-btn bg-white p-4 text-left">
              <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black">🏰 第7課專攻測驗</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-[#7a5f4b] mt-1 font-bold">精選 13 題・滿分 100 分</div>
            </button>
            <button onclick="selectQuizScope('l8')" id="scope-l8" class="sketch-btn bg-white p-4 text-left">
              <div class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black">🍱 第8課專攻測驗</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-[#7a5f4b] mt-1 font-bold">精選 12 題・滿分 100 分</div>
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <button onclick="startQuiz()" class="sketch-btn bg-[#80ED99] w-full py-4 text-xl font-black">
          🚀 開始測驗！
        </button>
      </div>

      <!-- 階段二：作答畫面（即答即評解析模式） -->
      <div id="quiz-stage-playing" class="hidden max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-4">
        <!-- 頂部狀態與進度條 -->
        <div class="sketch-card bg-[#FFF3B0]/75 p-4">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm font-black mb-2">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#4a3525]" id="playScopeLabel">🌟 綜合總測驗</span>
              <span>🧑‍🎓 <span id="playStudentLabel">王小明</span></span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
              <span>📌 第 <span id="playCurrentNum">1</span> / <span id="playTotalNum">25</span> 題</span>
              <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white border-2 border-[#4a3525]">⏱️ <span id="playTimer">00:00</span></span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full h-3.5 bg-white border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-full overflow-hidden">
            <div id="playProgressBar" class="h-full bg-[#FF9EB5] transition-all duration-300" style="width: 4%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 題目卡片 -->
        <div id="questionCard" class="sketch-card bg-white p-5 sm:p-7">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-3">
            <span id="questionTag" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#D0EBFF] border-2 border-[#4a3525] text-xs font-black">第7課・字音字形</span>
            <span id="questionBadge" class="text-xs font-black text-[#7a5f4b]">第 1 題</span>
          </div>

          <h3 id="questionText" class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-black leading-relaxed mb-5">
            題目載入中...
          </h3>

          <!-- A / B / C / D 選項 -->
          <div id="optionsContainer" class="space-y-3"></div>

          <!-- 選答後即時顯示的對錯與白話解析盒 -->
          <div id="instantFeedbackBox" class="hidden mt-5 p-4 rounded-2xl border-2 border-[#4a3525] fade-in">
            <div id="instantFeedbackTitle" class="text-base sm:text-lg font-black mb-1"></div>
            <p id="instantFeedbackExplain" class="text-sm sm:text-base font-medium leading-relaxed"></p>
          </div>

          <!-- 下一步按鈕列 -->
          <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 pt-4 border-t-2 border-dashed border-[#DFD1BE]">
            <button onclick="resetToQuizSetup()" class="sketch-btn bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm text-[#7a5f4b]">
              🔙 回準備畫面
            </button>
            <button onclick="goNextOrFinish()" id="btnNextStep" class="hidden sketch-btn bg-[#FFF3B0] px-6 py-3 text-base font-black">
              下一題 ➡️
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 階段三：交卷結算畫面（Google Classroom 專用成績單） -->
      <div id="quiz-stage-result" class="hidden max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6">
        <!-- 獎章與成績總覽 -->
        <div class="sketch-card bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FFF3B0]/85 to-[#FFFFFF] p-6 sm:p-8 text-center">
          <div class="washi-tape washi-yellow"></div>
          <div class="flex justify-center mb-3">
            <!-- 可愛手繪獎章 SVG -->
            <svg width="96" height="96" viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none">
              <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="44" fill="#FFF3B0" stroke="#4a3525" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="6 4"/>
              <path d="M30 26 H70 V44 C70 57, 60 66, 50 66 C40 66, 30 57, 30 44 Z" fill="#FFD166" stroke="#4a3525" stroke-width="2.8"/>
              <path d="M30 32 C20 32, 18 46, 29 50" stroke="#4a3525" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <path d="M70 32 C80 32, 82 46, 71 50" stroke="#4a3525" stroke-width="2.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              <rect x="45" y="66" width="10" height="10" fill="#F4A261" stroke="#4a3525" stroke-width="2.5"/>
              <rect x="33" y="76" width="34" height="9" rx="4" fill="#E76F51" stroke="#4a3525" stroke-width="2.5"/>
              <path d="M50 34 L53 41 L60 42 L55 47 L56 54 L50 50 L44 54 L45 47 L40 42 L47 41 Z" fill="#FFFFFF" stroke="#4a3525" stroke-width="2"/>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black" id="resultEncourageTitle">太棒了！</h2>
          <div class="my-4 inline-flex items-baseline gap-2 bg-white border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-3xl px-7 py-3 shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#4a3525]">
            <span class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-[#E76F51]" id="resultScoreNum">100</span>
            <span class="text-xl font-black">/ 100 分</span>
          </div>

          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-2.5 mt-4 text-sm">
            <div class="bg-[#D8F3DC] border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-2.5">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7a5f4b]">答對題數</div>
              <div class="text-lg font-black text-[#2A9D8F]" id="resultCorrectRatio">25 / 25 題</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#FFD6E0] border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-2.5">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7a5f4b]">正確率</div>
              <div class="text-lg font-black text-[#E63946]" id="resultAccuracy">100%</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#D0EBFF] border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-2.5">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7a5f4b]">作答耗時</div>
              <div class="text-lg font-black text-[#1D6FA3]" id="resultDuration">02分10秒</div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-[#FFF3B0] border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-2.5">
              <div class="text-xs font-bold text-[#7a5f4b]">完成時間</div>
              <div class="text-xs font-black mt-1 leading-tight" id="resultFinishTime">2026/11/22 13:00:00</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Google Classroom 專用成績單確認與一鍵複製區 -->
        <div class="sketch-card bg-[#D8F3DC]/45 p-5 sm:p-6">
          <div class="washi-tape washi-pink"></div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-black mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span>📋</span> Google Classroom 專用成績單
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#7a5f4b] font-bold mb-4">
            如果剛才忘記填寫或打錯資料，可以在下方直接修改（會<strong>即時同步</strong>更新成績單與準備畫面喔！），確認後點按按鈕一鍵複製繳交！
          </p>

          <!-- 雙向同步的學生資料確認與修改欄 -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mb-4 bg-white border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl p-3.5">
            <div>
              <label for="resultClass" class="block text-xs font-black mb-1">班級（即時修改）</label>
              <input id="resultClass" type="text" placeholder="例如：五年一班" class="sketch-input w-full text-sm py-2" oninput="syncResultStudentInfo()" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="resultSeat" class="block text-xs font-black mb-1">座號（即時修改）</label>
              <input id="resultSeat" type="text" placeholder="例如：05" class="sketch-input w-full text-sm py-2" oninput="syncResultStudentInfo()" />
            </div>
            <div>
              <label for="resultName" class="block text-xs font-black mb-1">姓名（即時修改）</label>
              <input id="resultName" type="text" placeholder="例如：王小明" class="sketch-input w-full text-sm py-2" oninput="syncResultStudentInfo()" />
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 成績單文字預覽框 -->
          <div class="mb-4">
            <label for="reportPreview" class="block text-xs font-black text-[#7a5f4b] mb-1.5">📄 成績單文字預覽：</label>
            <textarea id="reportPreview" readonly rows="8" class="w-full border-2 border-[#4a3525] rounded-2xl bg-[#FFFDF6] p-3.5 text-sm font-bold leading-relaxed text-[#4a3525] focus:outline-none resize-none"></textarea>
          </div>

          <!-- 一鍵複製按鈕與再挑戰一次 -->
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
            <button onclick="copyReportText()" id="btnCopyReport" class="sketch-btn bg-[#FFD166] flex-1 py-4 px-5 text-base sm:text-lg font-black flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
              <span>📋</span>
              <span id="btnCopyReportLabel">一鍵複製成績單文字</span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="resetToQuizSetup()" class="sketch-btn bg-white py-4 px-5 text-base font-black shrink-0">
              🔄 再挑戰一次
            </button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 錯題復習清單 -->
        <div class="sketch-card bg-white p-5 sm:p-6">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 mb-4">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-black flex items-center gap-2"><span>📖</span> 錯題復習清單</h3>
            <span id="wrongSummaryBadge" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-[#FFD6E0] border-2 border-[#4a3525] text-xs font-black">共 0 題錯題</span>
          </div>
          <div id="wrongListContainer" class="space-y-3.5"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </section>
  </main>

  <!-- 頁尾 -->
  <footer class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 mt-10 text-center text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-[#7a5f4b]">
    115學年度上學期 南一版國小國語五上 第參單元〈用心看世界〉自主學習與 25 題線上測驗 ✨
  </footer>

  <!-- ==================== JavaScript 邏輯與 25 題完整題庫 ==================== -->
